<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (This piece captures the sound of a campus morning after the commute. From birds in the trees to wind, footsteps, and distant human activity, it reflects a quieter moment when movement gives way to atmosphere. It presents campus not only as a physical space, but as a remembered part of student life abroad.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [34]
>>
endobj
