211 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 69 0 R
/E (These sounds were chosen because memories of place are often shaped by small and ordinary details. Birdsong, wind, and distant campus activity may seem subtle, but they often stay in memory over time. This recording turns a simple morning environment into a fragment of sonic memory.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [36]
>>
endobj
