<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (The artistic intention is to reveal the invisible world of gaming through sound alone. Without visuals, listeners can still sense tension, strategy, excitement, and frustration purely through audio cues. The work aims to elevate ordinary gaming noises into a narrative soundscape that reflects personal emotion, spatial atmosphere, and the culture of online play.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [9]
>>
