<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 70 0 R
/E (We chose gaming sound as one of our portfolio elements because it naturally contains strong emotional variation, rhythmic patterns, and spontaneous vocal reactions. The dorm room provides a controlled environment that allows for clean recording and multiple takes. This type of soundscape also highlights how everyday sounds can become expressive artistic material.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [11]
>>
