<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 71 0 R
/E (This piece captures a late-night study reading scene. Through subtle ASMR sounds such as keyboard typing, page turning, writing, and drinking water, the recording recreates the calm and rhythmic atmosphere of studying alone at night. The soundscape gradually transitions into a soft reading segment, presenting the scene as an ASMR-style audiobook excerpt designed to promote relaxation, focus, and a gentle sense of companionship.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
284 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 71 0 R
/E (These sounds together recreate the familiar and ordinary atmosphere of a late night during study abroad life. The quiet, focused, and relaxed study environment can provide listeners with a sense of companionship, as if returning to moments of concentrated study at university. Through these subtle and everyday sounds, the piece evokes familiar memories while creating a comforting and soothing listening experience.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
